35d40b31-2524-4665-ae52-ae347c4dd879	beer_mesopotamia_3400_bce	Beer (Mesopotamia, 3400 BCE)	Beer	Grain	36.120000	44.365000	\N	\N	3400 BCE	-3400	beer_ancient_egypt_3500_bce	The earliest confirmed written evidence of beer in Mesopotamia dates back to around 3400 BCE. This evidence includes organic residue found in ceramic vessels, particularly at the site of Godin Tepe in modern-day Iran.	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	f574a2d9-40d9-49d0-86dd-c0f1866ad7ee	2026-02-03 16:13:48.178567+00	2026-02-03 16:20:06.046917+00	f	approved	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
