23c513c3-d1c3-47be-b878-1c4a23b489ce	aqua-vitae	Aqua Vitae 	Spirit	Grain	52.656492	-7.257158	Kilkenny	Ireland	1324	1324	\N	In 1324 the first written case of Grain based distillate in Ireland came from the Red Book of Ossory, written by the Bishop of Ossory Richard Du Ledred. It was made as a cure-all and prescribed to the congregation to alleviate phlegm and help them sing like angels 😇 , this beverage was later banded in several parishes due to consumption as they got a taste for this rich spicy beverage.	\N	\N	Red Book of Ossory 	\N	\N	548759e8-a549-4d3d-b754-a19719a020cd	548759e8-a549-4d3d-b754-a19719a020cd	2026-02-04 05:56:35.988643+00	2026-02-04 06:06:02.241951+00	f	approved	548759e8-a549-4d3d-b754-a19719a020cd	2026-02-04 05:56:35.93+00	\N	\N	\N	\N
